  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4609.14 Certification/Recertification Procedures for Alternative Monitoring Systems. The CO2 AAR of each unit for which the owner or operator intends to use an alternative monitoring system approved by the Administrator and, if applicable, the department under Subpart E of 40 CFR part 75 shall comply with the applicable notification and application procedures of 40 CFR 75.20(f).\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20",
